                "fallback": "#marketingb2b #europeanmarketing #newchapter | Armelle Jaclot",
                "text": ":rocket: I’m happy to share that I’ve started a new role as European Marketing Director at SATO Europe.\n\nMy focus is on building aligned, high-impact marketing across Europe to support business growth, working closely with teams to drive execution and measurable impact.\n\nSATO is a Japanese global company that combines a strong industrial heritage with digital labelling and auto-identification solutions to drive traceability, safety and efficiency.\n\nWorking in such a highly intercultural environment is challenging, but also a real opportunity to scale impact across regions.\n\nThank you to everyone who supported and trusted me through this move, and special thanks to Laurent Lassus for the opportunity to join the adventure.\n\nLooking ahead!\n\n#MarketingB2B #EuropeanMarketing #NewChapter",
