                "from_url": "https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/posts\/eernoult_is-weglot-going-to-die-now-that-chatgpt-activity-7425116153481506816-f1S3?utm_source=share&utm_medium=member_desktop&rcm=ACoAAACgR0AB6SQZY5-F9k_waRhMjGlUlk-ZV9I",
                "service_icon": "https:\/\/static.licdn.com\/aero-v1\/sc\/h\/al2o9zrvru7aqj8e1x2rzsrca",
                "id": 1,
                "original_url": "https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/posts\/eernoult_is-weglot-going-to-die-now-that-chatgpt-activity-7425116153481506816-f1S3?utm_source=share&amp;utm_medium=member_desktop&amp;rcm=ACoAAACgR0AB6SQZY5-F9k_waRhMjGlUlk-ZV9I",
                "fallback": "“Is Weglot going to die now that ChatGPT is here?” We get this question a lot at Weglot and I will be happy to answer it next week at AI Day.  The roundtable topic says it all: 𝗣𝗶𝘃𝗼𝘁 𝗼𝗿… | Eugene Ernoult",
                "text": "“Is Weglot going to die now that ChatGPT is here?” We get this question a lot at Weglot and I will be happy to answer it next week at AI Day.\n\nThe roundtable topic says it all:\n𝗣𝗶𝘃𝗼𝘁 𝗼𝗿 𝗣𝗲𝗿𝗶𝘀𝗵? 𝗪𝗵𝗲𝗻 𝘀𝗵𝗼𝘂𝗹𝗱 𝗔𝗜 𝗿𝗲𝗱𝗲𝗳𝗶𝗻𝗲 𝘆𝗼𝘂𝗿 𝗰𝗼𝗿𝗲 𝗯𝘂𝘀𝗶𝗻𝗲𝘀𝘀?\n\nWe have been promoting AI + human translation at Weglot for 10 years.\n\nAt the beginning, people made fun of us.\n\nToday, with ChatGPT, Claude and all the copilot-style AI tools, people are finally getting it.\n\nThat is great news.\n\nAnd yes, it is also a massive opportunity for Weglot to reinvent itself.\n\nIf you want the full story, see you at AI Day!\n\n𝘞𝘰𝘸, 𝘮𝘺 𝘵𝘦𝘢𝘴𝘪𝘯𝘨 𝘨𝘢𝘮𝘦 𝘪𝘴 𝘨𝘦𝘵𝘵𝘪𝘯𝘨 𝘱𝘳𝘦𝘵𝘵𝘺 𝘨𝘰𝘰𝘥, 𝘳𝘪𝘨𝘩𝘵? 𝘓𝘦𝘵 𝘮𝘦 𝘬𝘯𝘰𝘸 𝘪𝘯 𝘵𝘩𝘦 𝘤𝘰𝘮𝘮𝘦𝘯𝘵𝘴 :joy:\n\n:microphone: “Pivot or Perish? When should AI redefine your core business?”\n\nI will be glad to discuss this with:\nValerie Zapico, CEO at Valkuren\nSébastien Le Roy, Partner at Serena\nModerated by Jeremy Ohayon, Founder of R4Innov\n\n:round_pushpin: STATION F, Central Room\n:spiral_calendar_pad: February 10 | 4:10–4:40 PM\nOrganized by France Digitale, in partnership with PR[AI]RIE-PSAI.",
                "title": "“Is Weglot going to die now that ChatGPT is here?” We get this question a lot at Weglot and I will be happy to answer it next week at AI Day.  The roundtable topic says it all: 𝗣𝗶𝘃𝗼𝘁 𝗼𝗿… | Eugene Ernoult",
                "title_link": "https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/posts\/eernoult_is-weglot-going-to-die-now-that-chatgpt-activity-7425116153481506816-f1S3?utm_source=share&utm_medium=member_desktop&rcm=ACoAAACgR0AB6SQZY5-F9k_waRhMjGlUlk-ZV9I",
                "service_name": "linkedin.com"
            }
